### Legal & policies

### Compliance: which types are required, which exist
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/compliance?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Create the head
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "slug": "returns",
  "policyType": "RETURNS",
  "jurisdiction": "NL",
  "requiresAcceptance": true,
  "notifyCustomers": false,
  "showInFooter": true,
  "showAtCheckout": true,
  "translations": [{"language": "en", "title": "Returns & refunds", "body": "<h2>Return window</h2><p>30 days.</p>"}]
}

### Publish = cut version 1 (plain publish) …
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/1/publish?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### … or publish with an effective date and a note on the version
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/1/publish-version?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"effectiveFrom": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z", "note": "30-day window, buyer pays return shipping"}

### Version history / one version's text / restore old text onto the head
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/1/versions?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/1/versions/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

###
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/policies/1/versions/1/restore-text?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
